  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "用棋子、障碍和召唤物完成包围即可瞬杀敌棋，连 Boss 也适用。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Surround your opponent with pieces, obstacles, and summons to instantly eliminate enemy pieces, including bosses.",
