      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把战棋 RPG、围棋式思考与 Roguelite 随机事件结合到末日互毁生存局中。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "This game merges elements of tactical RPG, Go, and introduces Roguelite features. Players will need to make decisions among numerous random events and capability divergences, trying to survive in an apocalyptic game of mutual destruction.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1631670/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "玩家作为部族领袖，一边保护族人，一边追查女神实验室死亡游戏的真相。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "Players take on the role of a tribe's leader, who must protect their people while also unraveling the truth behind this deadly game...",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/1631670/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
